      "expected_diagnostics": [
        "SPEC-NO-BUDGET"
      ],
      "notes": "'a fixed table, not a judgement call' is the deterministic hint - a DMN task, not an agent. This is the one case in the corpus base SpiffWorkflow cannot parse: it has no parser for businessRuleTask, so P3's runner reports EXE-RUNNER-UNSUPPORTED here. That is a runner limitation, not an artifact defect - businessRuleTask is the correct BPMN element for a decision table, and swapping it for a serviceTask to please the runner would delete the deterministic signal this case exists to test."
